    "aliases": [
      "quality factor",
      "Q值",
      "品质因数"
    ],
    "hover_summary": "品质因数（Q）是谐振器储能相对损耗的无量纲指标；Q 越高，衰减越慢、共振越窄。工程上必须明确讨论的是无载 Q、外部 Q 还是加载 Q。",
    "id": "q_factor",
    "category": [
      "resonator physics",
      "RF engineering"
    ],
    "related_concepts": [
      "HOM impedance",
      "S parameter",
      "Wakefield"
    ]
  },
